<div class="reading"><p class="eyebrow">You don’t have to figure it out alone</p><h2>A little help with the next step.</h2><p>If there’s no suitable item, try another category or a broader area. Equipment availability and transportation are never guaranteed.</p><div class="grid two"><article class="panel"><h3>Help using FreeDME</h3><p>Account access, caregiver help, or trouble with a request.</p><button class="primary" data-action="help" data-id="">Try a sample help request</button></article><article class="panel"><h3>Pickup is a barrier?</h3><p>Record the barrier on your request. FreeDME does not arrange transport.</p><a class="" href="/recipient/dashboard">Go to My activity →</a></article></div><h2>Community resource directory preview</h2><p>The PRS names candidate organizations, including ReCARES and Ability Tools. These have not been verified here. This prototype does not claim partnerships, current eligibility, stock, hours or transport service.</p><div class="panel"><span class="badge warn">Publication pending review</span><h3 data-design-style="s0">Resource records will distinguish</h3><ul><li>Free equipment donations</li><li>Temporary equipment loans</li><li>Mixed-cost exchanges</li><li>Referral-only organizations</li></ul><p>Each published record needs verified official contact details, service area, cost model, restrictions, review date and reviewer.</p></div><div class="note warn">The support telephone number, staffed hours and response targets are not yet approved. No real support is available here. This is not an emergency service.</div></div>